ty available to the stewards, including","x":27,"y":200.2,"w":249.4,"h":8},{"s":"deleting lap times.","x":27,"y":210.2,"w":60.1,"h":8},{"s":"-","x":13.5,"y":219.4,"w":2.4,"h":8},{"s":"Any track limit noted or reported during qualifying, at T11 will entail the loss","x":27,"y":219.4,"w":249.4,"h":8},{"s":"of the relevant lap as well as the next lap assuming the driver remains on","x":27,"y":229.2,"w":249.3,"h":8},{"s":"track.","x":27,"y":239.3,"w":18.3,"h":8},{"s":"Appendix H – Yellow flags – Article 2.5.5.b.","x":13.5,"y":250.8,"w":141.3,"h":8},{"s":"-","x":13.5,"y":260.9,"w":2.4,"h":8},{"s":"Yellow flags mean danger, drivers must reduce the speed. Overtaking is","x":27,"y":260.9,"w":249.4,"h":8},{"s":"forbidden from the first yellow flag until you pass the green flag.","x":27,"y":270.7,"w":209.6,"h":8},{"s":"-","x":13.5,"y":279.8,"w":2.4,"h":8},{"s":"If double yellow flags are shown, drivers must reduce speed and be","x":27,"y":279.8,"w":249.4,"h":8},{"s":"prepared to change direction or stop. It is the onus of each driver to prove","x":27,"y":289.9,"w":249.4,"h":8},{"s":"that he slowed down. Double yellow flags also mean that marshals are","x":27,"y":298.8,"w":249.4,"h":8},{"s":"working on or beside the track.","x":27,"y":308.9,"w":101.1,"h":8},{"s":"-","x":13.5,"y":318.7,"w":2.4,"h":8},{"s":"Yellow / Red flag will always prevail, irrelevant of their origins (marshals,","x":27,"y":318.7,"w":249.4,"h":8},{"s":"onboard marshalling, track side panel).","x":27,"y":327.8,"w":126.9,"h":8},{"s":"Pit lane","x":295.2,"y":132.2,"w":25,"h":8},{"s":"-","x":295.2,"y":142.3,"w":2.4,"h":8},{"s":"Red light / green light at pit exit must be respected.","x":308.7,"y":142.3,"w":167,"h":8},{"s":"-","x":295.2,"y":152.2,"w":2.4,"h":8},{"s":"Pit entry road white line must be respected on LHS.","x":308.7,"y":152.2,"w":166.8,"h":8},{"s":"-","x":295.2,"y":161.3,"w":2.4,"h":8},{"s":"Pit exit road white line must be respected at LHS.","x":308.7,"y":161.3,"w":159.5,"h":8},{"s":"End of session